  "description": "\"Your True Nature Test\" is a psychological test game that diagnoses your \"true nature\" and \"hidden personality\" — just by answering questions with four choices.\n\nThat instinctive choice you made —\nit might actually be revealing your deepest psychology!\n\n· Sweet on the outside, but secretly calculating?\n· A mastermind who pulls everyone's strings!?\n\n\"How is this so accurate?! It's scary…!\"\n\"Had my friend play and their true nature came out — it was a blast!\"\n\nPerfect for enjoying solo at your own pace, or getting excited together with family, friends, or on stream — a party diagnosis game for everyone.\n\nReady to take a peek at your true self?\n\nーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー\nTT supports gaming content creators.\nNo permission from TT is required to stream or create gameplay content, whether for personal or commercial use.",
